---
// Exponential Backoff vs Full Jitter Comparison Diagram Component
---

<figure class="jitter-diagram" aria-labelledby="jitter-diagram-caption">
  <!-- Desktop SVG Layout (ViewBox 840x300, clear contrast, 25px+ bottom margin) -->
  <svg
    class="jitter-diagram__desktop"
    viewBox="0 0 840 300"
    role="img"
    aria-labelledby="jitter-diagram-title jitter-diagram-desc"
  >
    <title id="jitter-diagram-title">
      無抖動鋸齒共振 vs Full Jitter 流量平鋪對比圖
    </title>
    <desc id="jitter-diagram-desc">
      展示無抖動時所有重試在固定週期引發同步脈衝衝擊下游，而 Full Jitter
      將請求隨機分散在時間軸上，使流量平穩消除高峰。
    </desc>

    <!-- Box 1: No Jitter (Y: 20, Height: 115, Bottom margin: 25px) -->
    <g transform="translate(20, 20)">
      <rect
        width="800"
        height="115"
        rx="12"
        class="jitter-diagram__card jitter-diagram__card--bad"></rect>
      <text
        class="jitter-diagram__badge jitter-diagram__badge--bad"
        x="20"
        y="26">ANTI-PATTERN: NO JITTER</text
      >
      <text
        class="jitter-diagram__title jitter-diagram__title--bad"
        x="20"
        y="50">❌ 固定指數退避 (No Jitter) ➔ 同步共振鋸齒波</text
      >
      <text class="jitter-diagram__desc" x="20" y="74"
        >所有客戶端在 1s, 2s, 4s 瞬間同時重試，引發共振脈衝！</text
      >

      <!-- Pulse waves -->
      <g transform="translate(480, 45)">
        <rect x="0" y="30" width="300" height="2" class="jitter-diagram__axis"
        ></rect>
        <path
          d="M 10 30 L 30 0 L 50 30 M 90 30 L 110 -15 L 130 30 M 180 30 L 205 -35 L 230 30"
          class="jitter-diagram__spike-line"></path>
        <text
          class="jitter-diagram__axis-tag"
          x="30"
          y="44"
          text-anchor="middle">1s 尖峰</text
        >
        <text
          class="jitter-diagram__axis-tag"
          x="110"
          y="44"
          text-anchor="middle">2s 尖峰</text
        >
        <text
          class="jitter-diagram__axis-tag"
          x="205"
          y="44"
          text-anchor="middle">4s 尖峰</text
        >
      </g>
    </g>

    <!-- Box 2: Full Jitter (Y: 155, Height: 120, Bottom margin: 25px) -->
    <g transform="translate(20, 155)">
      <rect
        width="800"
        height="120"
        rx="12"
        class="jitter-diagram__card jitter-diagram__card--good"></rect>
      <text
        class="jitter-diagram__badge jitter-diagram__badge--good"
        x="20"
        y="26">RECOMMENDED: FULL JITTER</text
      >
      <text
        class="jitter-diagram__title jitter-diagram__title--good"
        x="20"
        y="50">✅ 結合 Full Jitter 全隨機抖動 ➔ 流量平鋪與自癒</text
      >
      <text class="jitter-diagram__desc" x="20" y="74"
        >每個客戶端在 [0, Backoff] 區間隨機選值，消除峰值衝擊。</text
      >

      <!-- Smooth flat waves -->
      <g transform="translate(480, 50)">
        <rect x="0" y="25" width="300" height="2" class="jitter-diagram__axis"
        ></rect>
        <path
          d="M 5 20 Q 25 10 45 22 T 85 18 T 125 22 T 165 19 T 205 21 T 245 20 T 285 22"
          class="jitter-diagram__smooth-line"></path>
        <text
          class="jitter-diagram__axis-tag jitter-diagram__axis-tag--good"
          x="150"
          y="44"
          text-anchor="middle">均勻分散時間軸・下游平順自癒</text
        >
      </g>
    </g>
  </svg>

  <!-- Mobile HTML Layout (<= 48rem) -->
  <div class="jitter-diagram__mobile">
    <div class="jitter-diagram__m-card jitter-diagram__m-card--bad">
      <div class="jitter-diagram__m-badge">ANTI-PATTERN</div>
      <h4 class="jitter-diagram__m-title">❌ 無抖動固定退避：共振鋸齒</h4>
      <p class="jitter-diagram__m-desc">
        多個併發請求在遭遇故障後，遵循相同的公式在相同秒數（如 1s, 2s,
        4s）同時發起重試，在下游形成劇烈尖峰脈衝，導致原本微小的抖動升級為永久雪崩。
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="jitter-diagram__m-card jitter-diagram__m-card--good">
      <div class="jitter-diagram__m-badge">BEST PRACTICE</div>
      <h4 class="jitter-diagram__m-title">
        ✅ Full Jitter 全隨機抖動：均勻平鋪
      </h4>
      <p class="jitter-diagram__m-desc">
        每次重試時在 <code>[0, Backoff]</code> 範圍內隨機挑選睡眠時長，打破所有客戶端的同步週期，使重試流量均勻散落在整個時間軸上，下游得以順利自癒。
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <figcaption id="jitter-diagram-caption" class="jitter-diagram__caption">
    圖：固定指數退避（鋸齒共振）與 Full Jitter（流量平鋪）的衝擊對比
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .jitter-diagram {
    margin: 2.5rem 0;
    padding: 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 1rem;
    border: 1px solid var(--dg-border);
    background: var(--dg-bg);
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .jitter-diagram__desktop {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }

  .jitter-diagram__mobile {
    display: none;
  }

  /* SVG Styles */
  .jitter-diagram__card {
    fill: var(--dg-card);
    stroke-width: 1.5;
  }

  .jitter-diagram__card--bad {
    stroke: var(--dg-red);
  }

  .jitter-diagram__card--good {
    stroke: var(--dg-green);
  }

  .jitter-diagram__badge {
    font-size: 11px;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
  }

  .jitter-diagram__badge--bad {
    fill: var(--dg-red);
  }

  .jitter-diagram__badge--good {
    fill: var(--dg-green);
  }

  .jitter-diagram__title {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
  }

  .jitter-diagram__title--bad {
    fill: var(--dg-red);
  }

  .jitter-diagram__title--good {
    fill: var(--dg-green);
  }

  .jitter-diagram__desc {
    fill: var(--dg-body);
    font-size: 12.5px;
    font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
  }

  .jitter-diagram__axis {
    fill: var(--dg-border);
  }

  .jitter-diagram__spike-line {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--dg-red);
    stroke-width: 2.5;
  }

  .jitter-diagram__smooth-line {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--dg-green);
    stroke-width: 2.5;
  }

  .jitter-diagram__axis-tag {
    fill: var(--dg-muted);
    font-size: 10.5px;
    font-family: system-ui, sans-serif;
  }

  .jitter-diagram__axis-tag--good {
    fill: var(--dg-green);
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .jitter-diagram__caption {
    margin-top: 1rem;
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--dg-muted);
    text-align: center;
  }

  /* Mobile */
  @media (max-width: 48rem) {
    .jitter-diagram__desktop {
      display: none;
    }

    .jitter-diagram__mobile {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 1.25rem;
    }

    .jitter-diagram__m-card {
      background: var(--dg-card);
      border-radius: 0.75rem;
      padding: 1.25rem;
      border: 1px solid var(--dg-border);
    }

    .jitter-diagram__m-card--bad {
      border-left: 4px solid var(--dg-red);
    }

    .jitter-diagram__m-card--good {
      border-left: 4px solid var(--dg-green);
    }

    .jitter-diagram__m-badge {
      font-size: 0.75rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
      margin-bottom: 0.25rem;
    }

    .jitter-diagram__m-card--bad .jitter-diagram__m-badge {
      color: var(--dg-red);
    }

    .jitter-diagram__m-card--good .jitter-diagram__m-badge {
      color: var(--dg-green);
    }

    .jitter-diagram__m-title {
      font-size: 1.125rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--dg-title);
      margin: 0 0 0.5rem 0;
    }

    .jitter-diagram__m-desc {
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      color: var(--dg-body);
      line-height: 1.5;
      margin: 0;
    }
  }

  /* Tokens & Theme */
  .jitter-diagram {
    --dg-bg: var(--color-card, #f8fafc);
    --dg-card: var(--color-surface, #ffffff);
    --dg-card-soft: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03);
    --dg-border: var(--color-border, #e2e8f0);
    --dg-title: #0f172a;
    --dg-body: #334155;
    --dg-muted: #64748b;
    --dg-green: #16a34a;
    --dg-red: #dc2626;
  }

  :global(:root[data-theme="dark"]) .jitter-diagram {
    --dg-bg: #0d1117;
    --dg-card: #161b22;
    --dg-card-soft: #21262d;
    --dg-border: #30363d;
    --dg-title: #f0f6fc;
    --dg-body: #c9d1d9;
    --dg-muted: #8b949e;
    --dg-green: #3fb950;
    --dg-red: #f85149;
  }
</style>
